  <Docs>
    <summary>Possible bitmap configurations.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Possible bitmap configurations. A bitmap configuration describes
            how pixels are stored. This affects the quality (color depth) as
            well as the ability to display transparent/translucent colors.</para>
      <para>
