        <summary>Each pixel is stored on 8 bytes.</summary>
        <value>To be added.</value>
        <remarks>
          <para>Each pixel is stored on 8 bytes. Each channel (RGB and alpha for translucency) is stored as a half-precision floating point value. This configuration is particularly suited for wide-gamut and HDR content.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/Bitmap.Config#RGBA_F16" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.graphics.Bitmap.Config.RGBA_F16</code>.</a></format></para>
